{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/documentation\/IncidenceMatrixModule","doc:\/\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/documentation\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/OrientedIncidenceMatrix"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/incidencematrixmodule\/orientedincidencematrix\/equatable-implementations"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/documentation\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/OrientedIncidenceMatrix\/Equatable-Implementations","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"article","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Operators","title":"Operators","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/documentation\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/OrientedIncidenceMatrix\/!=(_:_:)","doc:\/\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/documentation\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/OrientedIncidenceMatrix\/==(_:_:)"],"generated":true}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"role":"collectionGroup","modules":[{"name":"IncidenceMatrixModule"}],"title":"Equatable Implementations","roleHeading":"API Collection"},"references":{"doc://IncidenceMatrixModule/documentation/IncidenceMatrixModule/OrientedIncidenceMatrix/!=(_:_:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/documentation\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/OrientedIncidenceMatrix\/!=(_:_:)","abstract":[],"fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"!=","kind":"identifier"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/incidencematrixmodule\/orientedincidencematrix\/!=(_:_:)","kind":"symbol","title":"!=(_:_:)","role":"symbol"},"doc://IncidenceMatrixModule/documentation/IncidenceMatrixModule/OrientedIncidenceMatrix":{"url":"\/documentation\/incidencematrixmodule\/orientedincidencematrix","abstract":[{"text":"The oriented incidence matrix of a directed hypergraph: entry (v, p) is −1 when ","type":"text"},{"code":"v","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is a source","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of column ","type":"text"},{"code":"p","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", +1 when it is a target, and 0 otherwise. Gallo, Longo, Pallottino and Nguyen"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(1993) define a directed hypergraph’s matrix this way (aᵢⱼ = −1 for a tail node, 1 for a head"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"node); a directed graph’s edge is the column with one source and one target, the matrix of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"spectral graph theory (B·Bᵀ = L, Godsil–Royle §8.3) and NetworkX’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"incidence_matrix(oriented=True)"},{"type":"text","text":". It conforms to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DirectedHypergraph"},{"type":"text","text":", so the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Hypergraphs"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"algorithms (B- and F-connection, components, the clique expansion) run on it unchanged; it is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DirectedGraph"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OrientedIncidenceMatrix","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"OrientedIncidenceMatrix","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OrientedIncidenceMatrix","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/documentation\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/OrientedIncidenceMatrix","type":"topic"},"doc://IncidenceMatrixModule/documentation/IncidenceMatrixModule/OrientedIncidenceMatrix/==(_:_:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/documentation\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/OrientedIncidenceMatrix\/==(_:_:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Equal when both planes are equal cell for cell, with equal shape: a vertex on both sides"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"differs from one on neither, although both entries are 0."}],"fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"==","kind":"identifier"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:21IncidenceMatrixModule08OrientedaB0V","text":"OrientedIncidenceMatrix","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:21IncidenceMatrixModule08OrientedaB0V","text":"OrientedIncidenceMatrix","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/incidencematrixmodule\/orientedincidencematrix\/==(_:_:)","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"==(_:_:)","role":"symbol"},"doc://IncidenceMatrixModule/documentation/IncidenceMatrixModule":{"abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/documentation\/IncidenceMatrixModule","title":"IncidenceMatrixModule","url":"\/documentation\/incidencematrixmodule","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","type":"topic"}}}